Researching better-call/dist/types.d.ts, [`better-call`](https://github.com/better-auth/better-call) is a type dependency though not included in better-auth's devDependencies. The types file also references `StrictEndpoint` from better-call's [`endpoint.ts`](https://github.com/better-auth/better-call/blob/main/packages/better-call/src/endpoint.ts), though this was removed in [commit `84dbfce`](https://github.com/better-auth/better-call/commit/84dbfce6453ca6d33b5799c18d3fdf718e23dfa3#diff-6493a00a8d95abffd6a8e7e19bdbf0fcf16f7a4041bd97d02d1ed88e7b70eff7).

The following declaration module was written to type `StrictEndpoint`. It recovered some type information though there were still errors for `openAPI().endpoints.* satisfies Endpoint`. Some type parameters were then changed to make errors disappear. (Note the lines with `!` at end)

